1
00:00:01,430 --> 00:00:04,270
这个是我送的 这丝带算不上我的最佳作品
This one's from me. The ribboning isn't my best --

2
00:00:04,280 --> 00:00:05,180
我患了腕管综合症
I have carpal tunnel.

3
00:00:05,380 --> 00:00:07,300
我的新公司安排我入住了普雷斯科综合生活馆
My new company is putting me up at The Prescott,

4
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:09,340
一个奢华的住所 配备各种服务
a luxury residence with full amenities.

5
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:11,940
我承认 这种奢侈的生活
I admit, this extravagant lifestyle

6
00:00:11,940 --> 00:00:13,200
让我有那么一点不舒服
can make me a little uncomfortable.

7
00:00:13,800 --> 00:00:14,840
轻点 玛塔
Gentle, Marta!

8
00:00:15,620 --> 00:00:17,660
又是蜡烛 谢谢了啊 各位
Another candle. Thanks, everyone.

9
00:00:17,920 --> 00:00:19,160
艾丽克斯 你应该知道
Alex, you should know

10
00:00:19,160 --> 00:00:22,380
楼下美发沙龙里的那个骗子
that a crook works at the hair salon downstairs --

11
00:00:23,220 --> 00:00:24,640
威尼斯的阿道夫
Adolfo of Venice.

12
00:00:24,860 --> 00:00:26,520
他不是给那些明星染发的吗
Isn't he the colorist to the stars?

13
00:00:26,660 --> 00:00:28,840
谢谢询问 尽管我知道你知道这个事实
Thank you for asking even though I know you know.

14
00:00:28,840 --> 00:00:30,340
我恨他
I hate him.

15
00:00:30,660 --> 00:00:32,500
威尼斯的阿道夫实际上是
Adolfo of Venice is actually

16
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:35,320
贝克斯菲尔德的阿伦·卡普曼
Alan Carpman of Bakersfield.

17
00:00:35,320 --> 00:00:37,260
我们当年一起成为理发师
We started as hairdressers together,

18
00:00:37,260 --> 00:00:39,580
但他窃取了我的染发剂配方
but he stole my hair dye formula.

19
00:00:39,780 --> 00:00:41,760
对于一个满是可爱成员的家庭来说
For a family of generally lovely people,

20
00:00:41,760 --> 00:00:43,080
我们有好多宿敌啊
we sure have a lot of rivals.

21
00:00:43,500 --> 00:00:45,680
虽然大家在这里很开心 但你们该走了
You know what, it's been fun, but it's time to go.

22
00:00:45,680 --> 00:00:48,480
你还没拆开我和小卡送给你的蜡烛呢
You haven't even opened the candle that Cam and I got you.

23
00:00:48,480 --> 00:00:50,120
我们不能参观一下整栋大楼吗
And don't we get a tour of the building?

24
00:00:50,120 --> 00:00:51,800
这地方什么都有
This place has everything.

25
00:00:51,829 --> 00:00:54,364
射箭场 鲨鱼池 以及...
Um, an archery range, a shark tank, a --

26
00:00:54,940 --> 00:00:55,900
竟然还有西部世界
a Westworld?

27
00:00:56,320 --> 00:00:58,420
抱歉 我有个大项目得交工了
Sorry, I've got a huge project due.

28
00:00:58,420 --> 00:01:00,000
我们可以自己去探索
We can always just explore on our own.

29
00:01:00,400 --> 00:01:01,820
实际上 你们不行
Actually, you can't.

30
00:01:01,900 --> 00:01:04,060
公司有严格规定 客人都要在员工陪伴下才行
There's a strict "No unaccompanied guests" policy.

31
00:01:04,160 --> 00:01:05,960
一旦我违反了 他们就会把我赶走
I violate that, they kick me out.

32
00:01:06,120 --> 00:01:07,480
我会让泊车员把你们的车开出来的
I'll have the valet fetch your cars.

33
00:01:07,600 --> 00:01:08,700
从这里就可以安排吗
Oh, you can do that from here?

34
00:01:08,880 --> 00:01:10,080
是啊 一切都是自动的
Yeah, everything's automated.

35
00:01:10,090 --> 00:01:11,966
只需要有住户身份码就可以了
You just need a resident ID code.

36
00:01:30,335 --> 00:01:32,040
-再见 菲尔 -再见
- Bye, Phil. - Bye.

37
00:01:32,040 --> 00:01:33,120
好了 我把车停在路旁了
All right, well, I parked on the street,

38
00:01:33,200 --> 00:01:34,040
我们回家见吧
so I'll just meet you at home.

39
00:01:34,060 --> 00:01:35,940
-再见 克莱尔 -我需要去一趟商场
- Bye, Claire. - I need to run to the mall.

40
00:01:36,020 --> 00:01:38,120
你能从农贸市场买些牛排晚上吃吗
Would you pick up some steaks from the farmers market for tonight?

41
00:01:38,140 --> 00:01:39,540
所以你还记得今晚是约会之夜
Oh, so you did remember it's date night.

42
00:01:39,548 --> 00:01:41,600
你没回我的无纸化邀请函 让我还有点担心呢
I was a little worried after your response to my Paperless Post.

43
00:01:41,600 --> 00:01:42,860
拜托
Oh, come on.

44
00:01:42,869 --> 00:01:45,460
你知道我说的"或许"最终都是"确定参加"
You know my maybes always turn into will attends.

45
00:01:45,460 --> 00:01:45,980
好的
Okay.

46
00:01:47,560 --> 00:01:49,420
你和我上一次
When was the last time that you and I

47
00:01:49,420 --> 00:01:51,440
一起准备浪漫晚餐是什么时候了
cooked a romantic dinner together?

48
00:01:51,440 --> 00:01:52,540
我们上周才弄过啊
We did it last week.

49
00:01:52,540 --> 00:01:56,950
我说的可不是简单地把热狗片撒在披萨上
I'm not talking about sprinkling hot dog slices on a DiGiorno's.

50
00:02:00,020 --> 00:02:02,320
你就不能在我挨说之前把车开来吗
You couldn't bring my car before I got in trouble?

51
00:02:07,880 --> 00:02:08,620
谢谢
Thank you.

52
00:02:12,320 --> 00:02:15,180
我一直悄悄在网上当美食博主
I've been secretly moonlighting as an online food blogger,

53
00:02:15,340 --> 00:02:16,140
账号叫"帽衫美食家"
"Foodie in a Hoodie"

54
00:02:16,580 --> 00:02:17,520
是一个押韵的名字
it rhymes on the page.

55
00:02:18,020 --> 00:02:20,400
我很快就收获了一大批粉丝
I've quickly developed a huge following,

56
00:02:20,400 --> 00:02:23,200
普雷斯科综合生活馆有着全市最火的餐厅
and The Prescott is home to the city's hottest restaurant,

57
00:02:23,200 --> 00:02:23,880
叫"什么餐厅"
called Pardon.

58
00:02:24,400 --> 00:02:24,880
你好
Hello.

59
00:02:25,260 --> 00:02:26,040
您好 先生
Ah, good day, sir.

60
00:02:26,960 --> 00:02:28,060
请原谅 我是新来的
Forgive me. I'm new here.

61
00:02:28,100 --> 00:02:29,380
我还在努力认识这里所有的住户
Still getting to know each of the tenants.

62
00:02:29,700 --> 00:02:30,940
我是这里的管理员希金斯
I'm your concierge, Higgins.

63
00:02:31,340 --> 00:02:33,180
你看着好眼熟啊 我们以前见过吗
You look so familiar. Have we met?

64
00:02:33,539 --> 00:02:34,880
恐怕没有
'Fraid not, no.

65
00:02:34,880 --> 00:02:35,960
不过经常有人这么说
I do get that a lot, though.

66
00:02:35,960 --> 00:02:38,080
我长着一张大众脸 大众身材
I have an everyman face and body.

67
00:02:41,600 --> 00:02:42,500
机器人崛起了
They're rising.

68
00:02:43,300 --> 00:02:44,280
没错 芬利
Ah, yes, Finley.

69
00:02:44,280 --> 00:02:46,169
它负责巡查大楼 搜出非住户
Patrols the building for non-residents

70
00:02:46,180 --> 00:02:48,000
全靠运动感应器和面部扫描仪
using a motion sensor and face scanner.

71
00:02:48,540 --> 00:02:51,760
确实非常有用 但它拥有独特的人类本事
Useful, yes, but does he have that uniquely human ability

72
00:02:51,760 --> 00:02:53,820
能提前预料到人的每一项需求吗
to anticipate a person's every need?

73
00:02:54,300 --> 00:02:54,820
喝椰子水吗
Coconut water?

74
00:02:55,060 --> 00:02:57,060
我都没意识到我想喝水呢
I didn't even know I wanted this!

75
00:02:57,420 --> 00:02:58,340
芬利 走开
Finley, away!

76
00:02:59,260 --> 00:03:00,400
还有什么能帮到您的吗 先生
Anything else I can help you with, sir?

77
00:03:01,660 --> 00:03:03,840
没了 我直接去餐厅
No. I'm just headed down to the restaurant.

78
00:03:04,300 --> 00:03:04,600
什么
Pardon?

79
00:03:04,600 --> 00:03:07,140
你们的 内部食堂
Your...in-house eatery.

80
00:03:07,140 --> 00:03:07,580
什么
Pardon?

81
00:03:07,639 --> 00:03:11,680
就是 服务生 餐具 每日特色菜
You know -- uh, waiters, cutlery, daily specials.

82
00:03:11,680 --> 00:03:12,320
好像是叫"什么餐厅"
I think it's called Pardon.

83
00:03:12,374 --> 00:03:14,600
-当然了 我的错 -没事
- Of course. My mistake. - It's all right.

84
00:03:14,600 --> 00:03:15,220
请这边走
Right this way.

85
00:03:15,460 --> 00:03:17,420
要躲避安保机器人会很棘手
Avoiding the security robot would be tricky,

86
00:03:17,660 --> 00:03:18,740
但芬利有个弱点
but Finley had a weakness --

87
00:03:18,840 --> 00:03:20,340
它只能侦测到在移动的人
he can only detect people if they're moving.

88
00:03:20,900 --> 00:03:21,820
那值得冒险啊
And it was worth the risk --

89
00:03:21,840 --> 00:03:23,840
"什么餐厅"的小汉堡号称是全世界最美味的
Pardon claimed to have the world's best beef slider,

90
00:03:23,840 --> 00:03:26,393
我的粉丝全都超想看到我的点评
and my -- my followers are dying for a review.

91
00:03:26,540 --> 00:03:27,340
除了一个人
Well, all but one.

92
00:03:28,080 --> 00:03:29,360
我有个黑子
I have a troll.

93
00:03:29,683 --> 00:03:33,507
网名叫"厨巨王走" 鬼知道那是什么
Screen name "Close to Utlaw," Wherever that is.

94
00:03:33,507 --> 00:03:36,200
我们最近在评论里发生了撕逼大战
We recently got into a -- a heated comment war.

95
00:03:36,200 --> 00:03:38,880
脏话乱飚 操爹骂娘
Insults were hurled, mothers disparaged.

96
00:03:38,880 --> 00:03:41,540
谁能想到网络这么负能量呢
Who knew the Internet could be so negative?

97
00:03:42,340 --> 00:03:44,080
一人位 我住这里
Table for one. I live here.

98
00:03:44,160 --> 00:03:45,300
刚出来个空桌
Something just opened up.

99
00:03:45,380 --> 00:03:47,500
好极了 带路吧 我住这里
Great, lead the way. I live here.

100
00:03:53,380 --> 00:03:54,650
嗨 我初来乍到
Hi. Uh, I'm new here.

101
00:03:54,660 --> 00:03:56,460
你能领我去放映室吗
Could you lead me to the screening room?

102
00:03:56,700 --> 00:03:57,660
我觉得可以吧
I should think so.

103
00:03:57,840 --> 00:04:00,240
在管家学院 我在领路方面可是全班第一名
At the butler academy, I led my class in leading.

104
00:04:00,880 --> 00:04:01,400
这边请
This way.

105
00:04:01,400 --> 00:04:03,920
最近 我搞到了有史以来
Recently, I got a special edition Blu-ray

106
00:04:03,920 --> 00:04:06,640
最伟大的电影《阿拉伯的劳伦斯》的蓝光盘
of the best movie ever made, "Lawrence of Arabia."

107
00:04:06,735 --> 00:04:08,113
据传 普雷斯科综合生活馆
Word is, The Prescott has

108
00:04:08,124 --> 00:04:11,449
拥有最顶尖的放映室 带环绕声
a state-of-the-art screening room with surround sound.

109
00:04:11,460 --> 00:04:12,600
知道它没有什么吗
Know what it doesn't have?

110
00:04:13,280 --> 00:04:13,620
曼尼
Manny.

111
00:04:13,631 --> 00:04:16,569
拜托 我觉得这里用推拉镜头才更合适吧
Hello! I would've gone with a tracking shot there.

112
00:04:17,800 --> 00:04:20,220
希望他在沙漠里能找到精彩情节
I sure hope he finds a plot out there in that desert.

113
00:04:22,660 --> 00:04:24,500
看吧 我们出名的糖果墙
Behold, our famous candy wall.

114
00:04:25,160 --> 00:04:26,380
嘿 甜心宝宝
Hey, Sugar Babies.

115
00:04:26,780 --> 00:04:27,460
什么事 糖心贝贝
Yes, honey buns?

116
00:04:27,680 --> 00:04:30,560
不 甜心宝宝是有史以来最适合看电影时吃的糖
No, Sugar Babies. The greatest movie candy of all time.

117
00:04:30,700 --> 00:04:31,500
万分抱歉
A thousand apologies.

118
00:04:31,760 --> 00:04:33,460
我马上去给您弄一些来
I will track some down for you straight away.

119
00:04:33,660 --> 00:04:35,340
-你不介意吗 -介意什么 拜托
- You wouldn't mind? - Mind? Please.

120
00:04:35,380 --> 00:04:36,400
我最大的乐趣
There is no greater joy

121
00:04:36,400 --> 00:04:38,360
就是去搞到一些我从未听过的东西
than fetching something I've never heard of

122
00:04:38,360 --> 00:04:40,460
给一个我刚认识的人
for someone I've only just met.

123
00:04:43,840 --> 00:04:45,000
请问有什么需要帮忙的吗
May I help you with something?

124
00:04:45,000 --> 00:04:47,327
不用 我只是在等人而已
No, I'm just -- I'm waiting for someone.

125
00:04:47,540 --> 00:04:49,900
那个人叫大卫·贝克汉姆
And his name is David Beckham.

126
00:04:49,980 --> 00:04:51,560
他就住在普雷斯科综合生活馆
Resident at The Prescott.

127
00:04:51,800 --> 00:04:52,920
米奇很讨厌我做这种事
Okay, Mitchell hates it when I do this,

128
00:04:52,940 --> 00:04:54,380
但我每次遇见名人
but every time I meet a celebrity,

129
00:04:54,380 --> 00:04:56,360
我都拜托他们帮我录来电语音应答
I ask them to record my outgoing message.

130
00:04:56,700 --> 00:04:58,860
我现在用的是我在银行遇到史诺普·道格时录的
My current one is from when I saw Snoop Dogg at a bank.

131
00:04:59,580 --> 00:05:01,460
抱歉我没看见你 如你所见
Sorry I missed you. As you can see --

132
00:05:01,780 --> 00:05:02,520
老子在忙
I'm busy!

133
00:05:02,640 --> 00:05:04,020
有时事情会...
And sometimes things can --

134
00:05:04,020 --> 00:05:05,140
离老子远点
Get away from me!

135
00:05:05,240 --> 00:05:07,140
请留言 并留下你的电话号码
Please leave a message, including your phone number,

136
00:05:07,140 --> 00:05:08,280
那是为了...保安[安全着想]
just for -- Security!

137
00:05:10,038 --> 00:05:12,500
宝贝 什么事 我这会儿有点忙
Hey, sweetie, what's up? I'm -- I'm kind of busy.

138
00:05:12,500 --> 00:05:13,700
小卡 我受伤了 是我的腿
Cam, I'm hurt. It's my leg.

139
00:05:13,920 --> 00:05:14,220
什么
What?

140
00:05:14,580 --> 00:05:15,940
我在美食街滑倒了
I slipped in the food court,

141
00:05:15,940 --> 00:05:18,420
现在全身都粘粘的 而且还被十岁小屁孩嘲笑
and I'm all sticky and tweens are laughing at me.

142
00:05:18,660 --> 00:05:19,800
你一定要来接我
You have to come pick me up.

143
00:05:19,800 --> 00:05:20,972
听起来好惨 但是
Well, that sounds awful, but --

144
00:05:21,861 --> 00:05:23,800
克莱尔不是离你更近吗
Isn't -- Isn't Claire closer?

145
00:05:23,800 --> 00:05:25,740
可你就在街尾的农贸市场啊
Well, you're at the farmers market right down the street.

146
00:05:25,860 --> 00:05:27,020
行吧 我这就来
Okay, fine. I'm on my way.

147
00:05:28,836 --> 00:05:30,290
老公你最好啦
Aww, you're the best.

148
00:05:30,460 --> 00:05:32,580
我绝不能让小卡毁了我当面感谢
I was not gonna let Cam ruin my chance

149
00:05:32,580 --> 00:05:37,060
我的壁纸 维多利亚·贝克汉姆的机会
to thank my wallpaper, Victoria Beckham, one-on-one.

150
00:05:37,060 --> 00:05:38,280
当时是1997年
Okay, so, it was 1997.

151
00:05:38,760 --> 00:05:41,380
我和女朋友在底特律看辣妹合唱团演唱会
I was in Detroit for a Spice Girls concert with my girlfriend.

152
00:05:41,740 --> 00:05:43,440
我本来打算向她求婚的
I was going to propose to her,

153
00:05:43,440 --> 00:05:45,480
戒指什么的都准备好了
had the ring in my pocket and everything,

154
00:05:45,740 --> 00:05:49,060
结果时髦辣妹从台上径直看向我 并说道
when from the stage, Posh looked right at me and said,

155
00:05:49,420 --> 00:05:50,820
"要直面真正的你 米奇尔"
"Be true to yourself, Mitchell!"

156
00:05:51,837 --> 00:05:53,500
好吧 她说的可能是"密歇根"
Okay, you know, she might've said "Michigan,"

157
00:05:53,500 --> 00:05:55,340
但她当时目光正对着我
but she was looking right at me!

158
00:05:55,560 --> 00:05:58,420
那一晚我受到她的鼓舞而出柜
She inspired me to come out that night.

159
00:05:58,453 --> 00:06:00,789
我把那颗钻石挂到脚链上当幸运符
I had that diamond reset as an anklet charm,

160
00:06:00,800 --> 00:06:01,800
接下来我就夜夜笙歌了
and I was off to the races.

161
00:06:02,680 --> 00:06:04,520
那到底是哪门子的奇葩健身袋啊
What kind of gym bag is that, anyway?

162
00:06:04,520 --> 00:06:06,820
这是挎包 你个无知白痴
It's a satchel, you ignorant sneeze.

163
00:06:07,700 --> 00:06:09,820
你最近好暴躁好讨厌
You have been so unpleasant lately.

164
00:06:10,300 --> 00:06:11,820
与他这态度绝对有关的就是
On a definitely related note,

165
00:06:11,820 --> 00:06:14,018
曼尼有好几个月没做过床上"运动"了
Manny hasn't gotten any action in months.

166
00:06:14,240 --> 00:06:16,580
好吧 除了害他得腕管综合征的运动外
Well, other than whatever gave him carpal tunnel.

167
00:06:16,654 --> 00:06:20,280
幸好普雷斯科综合生活馆有80年代有氧健身操课程
Luckily, The Prescott has an '80s aerobi-cise class,

168
00:06:20,280 --> 00:06:22,400
现场会有很多单身熟女
which will be full of single older ladies.

169
00:06:23,340 --> 00:06:25,280
女人一过40岁就到达一个黄金交叉点
Women hit a sweet spot right after 40

170
00:06:25,320 --> 00:06:26,620
那时她们外表仍然美丽
where they still look great

171
00:06:26,620 --> 00:06:28,180
但对男人的要求大大降低
but their standards have lowered.

172
00:06:30,800 --> 00:06:32,620
你身材保持得不错啊 毕竟你已经...
You're in pretty good shape for someone who's...

173
00:06:34,520 --> 00:06:35,260
我才38
I'm 38.

174
00:06:36,100 --> 00:06:36,500
再见
Bye.

175
00:06:38,660 --> 00:06:38,980
希金斯
Higgins.

176
00:06:40,100 --> 00:06:41,420
贝克汉姆先生 抱歉
Oh, Mr. Beckham. Apologies.

177
00:06:41,420 --> 00:06:42,978
我没戴眼镜时就跟蝙蝠一样眼瞎
Blind as a bat without these bad boys.

178
00:06:42,978 --> 00:06:46,770
我和柯特妮跟保龄球教练约好了
So, myself and Courteney are expecting a bowling instructor.

179
00:06:46,780 --> 00:06:47,620
麻烦你叫他
Would you have him meet us

180
00:06:47,620 --> 00:06:49,200
到楼下的保龄球馆找我们 好吗
downstairs at the bowling alley, please?

181
00:06:49,211 --> 00:06:50,285
你和考克斯女士要为
You and Ms. Cox getting an edge

182
00:06:50,285 --> 00:06:51,960
周末的名人马拉松保龄球赛大练身手吗
for this weekend's celebrity bowl-a-thon?

183
00:06:51,960 --> 00:06:52,960
我们绝对需要练习
Oh, we'll need it.

184
00:06:52,960 --> 00:06:54,930
你没看到去年比赛他打得有多烂
You should've seen the way he bowled last year.

185
00:06:54,940 --> 00:06:57,080
可那比赛只是要为慈善筹款啊
I mean, it is to raise money for charity.

186
00:06:57,090 --> 00:07:00,577
没错 你总共击倒的18个瓶募到18块钱呢
Yeah, a dollar for each of the 18 pins that you knocked down.

187
00:07:00,700 --> 00:07:02,380
多亏了你 无国界医生们
Thanks to you, Doctors Without Borders

188
00:07:02,380 --> 00:07:04,080
现在成了无痢疾药医生
are now Doctors Without Malaria Pills.

189
00:07:04,307 --> 00:07:05,554
有点毒
A bit harsh.

190
00:07:13,840 --> 00:07:15,380
你看到后面那两位女士了吗
Did you see the two friends in the back?

191
00:07:15,415 --> 00:07:17,948
金发那个喜欢我 褐发那个一直盯着你看
The blond one liked me, and the brunette kept staring at you.

192
00:07:17,960 --> 00:07:18,840
你能怪她吗
Can you blame her?

193
00:07:18,840 --> 00:07:21,252
我跳《加勒比海女王》的舞步 无人能及
No one moves to "Caribbean Queen" Like me.

194
00:07:22,780 --> 00:07:24,620
我正要找你们
Ah, just who I was told to be on the lookout for.

195
00:07:24,880 --> 00:07:26,020
有两个人叫你们
A certain couple have asked

196
00:07:26,020 --> 00:07:27,220
去保龄球馆找他们
that you meet them in the bowling alley.

197
00:07:27,520 --> 00:07:28,660
是不是一位金发 一位棕发的
Was it a blonde and a brunette?

198
00:07:29,020 --> 00:07:30,880
没错 而且他们等不及要"开滚"了
Indeed, and they seemed eager to get rolling.

199
00:07:32,680 --> 00:07:33,380
保龄球馆
Bowling alley?

200
00:07:34,040 --> 00:07:35,300
这些妹子口味真重
These girls are freaky.

201
00:07:37,200 --> 00:07:37,540
美发沙龙在哪
Hair salon?

202
00:07:37,760 --> 00:07:39,360
-穿过院子 在您右手边 -谢谢
- Just off the courtyard to your right. - Thank you.

203
00:07:39,940 --> 00:07:41,680
我一直想把头发染成深色
I've always wanted to dye my hair dark.

204
00:07:41,740 --> 00:07:43,940
但我放心委以重任的染发师只有一位
But there's only one colorist I would trust to do it --

205
00:07:44,540 --> 00:07:45,960
威尼斯的阿道夫
Adolfo of Venice.

206
00:07:46,200 --> 00:07:47,220
歌洛莉亚的死对头
Gloria's sworn enemy.

207
00:07:47,340 --> 00:07:50,140
我得偷偷绕回来染发 不让她知道
I just have to sneak back in and do it without her knowing.

208
00:08:02,840 --> 00:08:03,560
妈妈好啊
Hi, Mom.

209
00:08:04,140 --> 00:08:05,500
艾丽克斯 宝贝
Hi, Alex. Hey, honey.

210
00:08:05,500 --> 00:08:06,866
你的项目进展如何
So, how's the project going?

211
00:08:09,173 --> 00:08:11,480
不会吧 好惨哦
Oh, yeah, no, that -- that -- that's tough...

212
00:08:11,480 --> 00:08:12,840
听到你这么说我很难过
I'm sorry -- sorry to hear that.

213
00:08:12,920 --> 00:08:14,240
工作真是让我压力山大
Work is so stressful.

214
00:08:14,271 --> 00:08:16,060
我得挂了 爱你哦 再见
Yeah, got to go, love you! Bye!

215
00:08:17,620 --> 00:08:18,380
泳池在哪
The pool?

216
00:08:18,800 --> 00:08:19,760
您进电梯
Just hop on the elevator

217
00:08:19,760 --> 00:08:21,620
按下写着"泳池"的大按键就能到达
and press the big button marked "Pool."

218
00:08:22,300 --> 00:08:25,280
众人皆知我是这个家里最大胆无畏的
I am known as the fearless one of the family.

219
00:08:25,280 --> 00:08:27,322
所以克莱尔给我们下周
So, when Claire gave us all free passes

220
00:08:27,322 --> 00:08:29,927
快乐镇水上乐园的免费票后
for the Fun Town Water Park next week,

221
00:08:30,071 --> 00:08:33,138
我不敢承认我怕滑滑梯
I couldn't admit that I am afraid of slides.

222
00:08:33,200 --> 00:08:36,680
水上滑梯速度好快 我觉得自己都要飞出去了
They go so fast, I feel like I'm going to fly off.

223
00:08:37,120 --> 00:08:40,840
我需要先滑一次 到时我就不怕了
I just need to try it once and I am going to be fine.

224
00:08:41,480 --> 00:08:43,080
我做不到
I cannot do it!

225
00:08:43,360 --> 00:08:44,520
不准反悔哦
Hey, no backsies!

226
00:08:46,980 --> 00:08:48,780
好吧 我滑了
Okay, here I go!

227
00:08:52,720 --> 00:08:55,900
你应该让我反悔的
You should have let me do backsies!

228
00:08:58,600 --> 00:09:01,260
住户已进入 美发沙龙
Resident ID access -- hair salon.

229
00:09:01,840 --> 00:09:03,240
什么 谁偷用了我的密码
What? Who's using my code?!

230
00:09:06,591 --> 00:09:09,358
你看起来就像那个女演员
You a-look like that a-actress...

231
00:09:09,460 --> 00:09:10,660
奥黛丽·赫本
Audrey Hepburn.

232
00:09:15,700 --> 00:09:17,820
我是菲尔·邓菲 请留言
This is Phil Dunphy. Leave a message.

233
00:09:18,440 --> 00:09:21,040
菲尔 我晚点有个惊喜送给你
Phil, I have a little surprise for you later.

234
00:09:21,240 --> 00:09:24,060
这么说吧 我知道你有多喜欢褐发美女
Let's just say I know how much you love brunettes.

235
00:09:24,580 --> 00:09:26,740
-菜单给您 -谢谢
- Here's a menu for you. - Thank you.

236
00:09:27,580 --> 00:09:29,440
先拍张照片
And for my followers...

237
00:09:31,220 --> 00:09:33,200
吊吊我粉丝们的胃口
an Instagram tease.

238
00:09:35,480 --> 00:09:37,160
您的甜心宝宝 先生
Your Sugar Babies, sir.

239
00:09:37,160 --> 00:09:38,400
希望没让你太费心
I hope it wasn't too much trouble.

240
00:09:38,560 --> 00:09:39,420
恰恰相反
On the contrary.

241
00:09:39,960 --> 00:09:41,720
街对面的公园里正在举办
There was a Mexican birthday celebration

242
00:09:41,720 --> 00:09:43,540
墨西哥生日庆祝会
taking place in the park across the street.

243
00:09:43,540 --> 00:09:45,500
我等他们敲破塞满糖果的皮纳塔后
I waited for the crack of the pinata,

244
00:09:45,500 --> 00:09:47,300
就无耻地混进小孩子中间
mixed in seamlessly with the children,

245
00:09:47,300 --> 00:09:48,260
伺机猛抢糖果
and pounced.

246
00:09:54,040 --> 00:09:55,040
他也在这吗
He's here?!

247
00:09:55,040 --> 00:09:57,460
一个白痴美食博主攻击
Some moron food blogger took a shot

248
00:09:57,460 --> 00:09:58,640
我最喜欢的其中一家餐厅
at one of my favorite spots.

249
00:09:58,840 --> 00:10:01,580
于是我用艺名"橱柜狂徒"去网上骂他
So I go after him using my screen name, "Closet Outlaw."

250
00:10:01,740 --> 00:10:05,480
骂战升级 他唆使他一大票粉丝来围攻我
It escalates, and he turns his army of followers against me.

251
00:10:05,480 --> 00:10:07,100
我就在最后一条评论里写道
As I wrote in my last comment --

252
00:10:07,520 --> 00:10:10,380
"看看是我的拳头硬 还是你的脸硬"
"Let's see how well my fist pairs with your face."

253
00:10:12,400 --> 00:10:13,720
保龄球馆
The bowling alley?!

254
00:10:17,160 --> 00:10:18,220
艾丽克斯在这
Alex is here?!

255
00:10:18,340 --> 00:10:19,860
假如她看到我们 会赶我们出去的
If she sees us, she'll throw us out.

256
00:10:22,160 --> 00:10:23,120
不好意思
Excuse me.

257
00:10:24,060 --> 00:10:25,740
要是金发和棕发那两位来了
If that blonde and brunette come by,

258
00:10:25,740 --> 00:10:27,480
你能不能告诉他们碰面地点换了
could you tell them there's a new meet-up spot?

259
00:10:27,480 --> 00:10:29,080
换成顶楼的按摩浴缸
The hot tubs on the rooftop.

260
00:10:29,220 --> 00:10:31,360
当然 锻炼前先热身
Of course, warm things up a bit before your workout.

261
00:10:31,580 --> 00:10:32,920
假如您没有其他需求 我得继续检查
If there's nothing else, I need to make sure

262
00:10:32,920 --> 00:10:34,660
确保保龄球的重量没有标错
these balls are marked with their correct weights.

263
00:10:42,560 --> 00:10:43,500
给他10号的鞋
Size 10 for him

264
00:10:43,500 --> 00:10:45,480
给我一双有钢头的
and anything with a steel toe for me.

265
00:10:45,980 --> 00:10:47,340
某人总是出纰漏[掉球]
Someone drops his ball a lot.

266
00:10:47,420 --> 00:10:48,580
计划有变
There has been a change of plan.

267
00:10:48,660 --> 00:10:50,020
你们的保龄球教练说在顶楼碰面
Your bowling instructor would now like you to meet him

268
00:10:50,020 --> 00:10:52,320
要在按摩浴缸里热身
in the hot tubs for a warmup first.

269
00:10:52,340 --> 00:10:53,460
-楼上见吧 -好
- Meet you up there? - Yep.

270
00:10:54,023 --> 00:10:56,120
假如你想打给慈善机构换搭档
If you're calling the charity for a new partner,

271
00:10:56,120 --> 00:10:56,980
那是行不通的
it's not gonna work.

272
00:10:57,240 --> 00:10:58,440
他们已经做好海报了
They already made the posters.

273
00:10:59,620 --> 00:11:00,680
-可以点餐了吗 -迫不及待
- Ready to order? - Very.

274
00:11:00,860 --> 00:11:03,820
我来这间餐厅只想点一样菜品
I came to this restaurant for one thing and one thing only.

275
00:11:10,260 --> 00:11:11,660
是什么菜
And that thing is...?

276
00:11:11,660 --> 00:11:13,609
抱歉 来一份你们世上最肥...
Sorry. Uh, one of your world fa--

277
00:11:15,772 --> 00:11:17,643
世上最肥的热狗 这就来
One of our world's fattest hot dogs coming up.

278
00:11:17,643 --> 00:11:18,978
不 是肥美小汉堡
No! The-the slider.

279
00:11:20,060 --> 00:11:21,160
肉饼要几分熟
And how would you like it?

280
00:11:21,160 --> 00:11:21,892
我
Me...

281
00:11:23,961 --> 00:11:25,780
-是的 您 先生 -要三分熟
- Yes, you, sir. - ...dium rare.

282
00:11:25,780 --> 00:11:27,320
能请你送到泳池来吗
And can you have it delivered to the pool, please?

283
00:11:27,680 --> 00:11:28,260
当然
Of course.

284
00:11:30,740 --> 00:11:32,340
那份小汉堡送到泳池
Okay, that slider goes to the pool,

285
00:11:32,340 --> 00:11:34,760
还有一份贝克汉姆先生的送到顶楼
and it looks like we need one for Mr. Beckham to the roof.

286
00:11:34,880 --> 00:11:36,320
你见到过穿黑帽衫的家伙吗
You seen a guy in a black hoodie?

287
00:11:36,660 --> 00:11:37,600
-他刚走 -谢了
- Just left. - Thanks.

288
00:11:38,006 --> 00:11:38,880
我去去就回
Oh, I'll be back.

289
00:11:38,880 --> 00:11:40,840
我迫不及待想尝尝你们世上最肥的热狗
I'm dying to try one of your world's fattest hot dogs.

290
00:11:49,460 --> 00:11:50,860
你到商场了吗
Hey, you here at the mall?

291
00:11:51,180 --> 00:11:53,180
还没 你怎么喘得这么厉害
No, not yet. Why are you breathing so hard?

292
00:11:53,420 --> 00:11:55,600
一群孩子在我旁边抽电子烟
Oh, um, a bunch of kids were vaping next to me,

293
00:11:55,600 --> 00:11:57,971
我不得不伏地爬到香薰店里
and I had to army-crawl into a-a candle store.

294
00:11:58,112 --> 00:11:59,852
我来都来了 你想买什么吗
Yeah. Is there anything you want while I'm here?

295
00:12:00,040 --> 00:12:02,420
我能告诉你我"真正真正想要的"吗
Can I tell you what I want, what I really, really want?

296
00:12:02,720 --> 00:12:04,060
你正在看着我对吗
You're watching me right now, aren't you?

297
00:12:05,383 --> 00:12:06,393
小卡 好吧
Cam, okay, look.

298
00:12:06,393 --> 00:12:08,309
我只是希望能在健身房
I was hoping I'd run into Posh

299
00:12:08,340 --> 00:12:10,540
遇到时髦辣妹聊上两句 好吗
here at the gym for a private moment, okay?

300
00:12:10,780 --> 00:12:12,320
我们都希望遇到贝克汉姆夫妇
Look, we're both after the Beckhams.

301
00:12:12,920 --> 00:12:14,240
我们一起制定一个计划
Let's come up with a plan together --

302
00:12:14,240 --> 00:12:15,535
在泳池酒吧等我
meet me at the swim-up bar.

303
00:12:15,535 --> 00:12:16,860
他们还有泳池酒吧
There's a swim-up bar?!

304
00:12:16,860 --> 00:12:18,660
就是说 我们才该住在这里
I know, we should be living here

305
00:12:18,660 --> 00:12:20,940
艾丽克斯该住在我们的破房子里
and Alex should be living in our stupid house.

306
00:12:33,260 --> 00:12:34,740
希金斯 我需要你
Higgins, I need you!

307
00:12:35,100 --> 00:12:36,320
你在哪
Where are you?!

308
00:12:38,977 --> 00:12:40,311
您似乎遇到小麻烦了
A spot of bother, I see?

309
00:12:40,320 --> 00:12:41,720
我做不到
I can't do it!

310
00:12:41,831 --> 00:12:42,760
您当然可以
Oh, of course you can.

311
00:12:42,760 --> 00:12:44,060
我爬到您身前
I'll just crawl in front of you

312
00:12:44,060 --> 00:12:45,220
您就可以抓住我的腰
so you can grab me around the waist.

313
00:12:45,800 --> 00:12:47,640
要是我笑出声了提前向您道歉
I apologize in advance for any giggling.

314
00:12:47,640 --> 00:12:49,380
我这人天生很怕痒
I'm cursed with the tickle gene.

315
00:12:49,960 --> 00:12:50,640
出什么事了
What's going on?

316
00:12:51,500 --> 00:12:52,740
有人卡在滑梯上了
Someone's stuck on the slide.

317
00:12:53,440 --> 00:12:54,720
她想爬回去 但是
She tried to climb back down, but --

318
00:12:54,720 --> 00:12:56,274
-滑梯不许反悔[倒退] 我懂 -是啊
- No backsies, I get it. - Yeah.

319
00:12:56,650 --> 00:12:57,839
那是我的
Oh, oh, oh! That's for me.

320
00:12:57,920 --> 00:12:58,860
谢谢
Thank you.

321
00:12:59,940 --> 00:13:01,800
-可是速度太快了 -不 别担心
- But it goes too fast! - Oh, no, don't worry.

322
00:13:01,840 --> 00:13:04,080
我将不断收缩臀部来控制我们的速度
I shall vary the flex of my buttocks to control our speed.

323
00:13:04,080 --> 00:13:04,723
我们会
We should be --

324
00:13:04,723 --> 00:13:05,824
不
No!

325
00:13:07,140 --> 00:13:09,120
请接受我最诚挚的歉意
My deepest apologies!

326
00:13:13,640 --> 00:13:14,520
不
Oh, no!

327
00:13:16,247 --> 00:13:16,926
好吧
Okay.

328
00:13:22,183 --> 00:13:23,627
不
Noooo!!

329
00:13:25,580 --> 00:13:26,820
麻烦解决
That one's sorted.

330
00:13:31,160 --> 00:13:33,620
送一些气泡水到按摩浴缸帐篷
I need some sparkling water sent up to the hot tub cabanas.

331
00:13:34,620 --> 00:13:35,360
不能说是给谁的
Can't say for whom,

332
00:13:35,400 --> 00:13:37,080
但附带一杯香槟
but let's include a glass of champagne

333
00:13:37,080 --> 00:13:39,800
以防他的"时髦"妻子一会儿也来
in case his posh wife joins him.

334
00:13:45,020 --> 00:13:45,580
小心
Easy.

335
00:13:45,580 --> 00:13:45,740
小心
Easy.

336
00:13:49,980 --> 00:13:50,860
有没有搞错
Come on!

337
00:13:52,160 --> 00:13:52,600
希金斯
Higgins!

338
00:13:53,860 --> 00:13:54,360
听我说
Um, listen...

339
00:13:54,940 --> 00:13:57,220
我需要你帮我弄来那个小汉堡[滑水者]
I need your help getting my hands on the slider.

340
00:13:57,800 --> 00:13:58,340
滑水者吗
The slider?

341
00:13:59,160 --> 00:14:00,020
当然
Oh, of course.

342
00:14:00,480 --> 00:14:01,460
看着就诱人
Quite a looker, that one.

343
00:14:01,540 --> 00:14:02,720
问题就在这 目前为止
Well, that's the problem -- so far,

344
00:14:02,720 --> 00:14:04,320
我只能看 还没尝到
I've only been able to look and not taste.

345
00:14:05,420 --> 00:14:08,260
无需多言 我会想办法将滑水者送来
Say no more. I shall find a way to deliver the slider to you.

346
00:14:08,260 --> 00:14:10,180
太好了 有没有什么隐蔽些的地方
Great! Um, is there somewhere private

347
00:14:10,180 --> 00:14:11,540
能让我单独享用它
where I could enjoy the slider alone?

348
00:14:12,280 --> 00:14:14,240
我建议您去我们顶楼的按摩浴缸
Might I suggest one of our rooftop hot tubs

349
00:14:14,240 --> 00:14:15,100
能眺望都市
overlooking the city?

350
00:14:15,100 --> 00:14:16,460
完美 我在那等着
Perfect, I'll wait there.

351
00:14:16,460 --> 00:14:19,000
我还需要一个围嘴 我总搞得满身污渍
And I'll-I'll need a bib -- I can make a mess.

352
00:14:27,380 --> 00:14:28,420
还很脆
Still crisp.

353
00:14:29,980 --> 00:14:31,020
他没走远
He's close.

354
00:14:36,060 --> 00:14:37,540
我怎么又到这来了
How'd I get back here?

355
00:14:44,584 --> 00:14:45,468
时髦辣妹
Ah, Posh.

356
00:14:45,900 --> 00:14:46,700
多谢
Thank you.

357
00:14:47,200 --> 00:14:48,660
您丈夫叫您去露台碰面
Your husband has asked that you meet him

358
00:14:48,660 --> 00:14:50,920
一起在按摩浴缸里喝香槟
up in one of the rooftop hot tubs for some champagne.

359
00:14:51,243 --> 00:14:52,233
菲尔
Phil.

360
00:15:02,610 --> 00:15:05,348
希金斯 真正的敌人不是滑梯
Higgins! The slides aren't the enemy.

361
00:15:05,348 --> 00:15:06,520
而是恐惧
Fear is.

362
00:15:06,520 --> 00:15:08,820
见到我们的住客成长总是如此激动人心
It's always a thrill to see one of my residents grow.

363
00:15:09,440 --> 00:15:11,080
顺带一提 某位神秘的先生
By the way, a certain mystery man

364
00:15:11,080 --> 00:15:12,340
在楼内注意到了您的存在
has spotted you around the building

365
00:15:12,340 --> 00:15:14,180
他希望您能去顶楼一聚
and has requested your presence on the roof.

366
00:15:14,841 --> 00:15:17,920
杰总算知道搞浪漫了
Jay's finally doing something romantic!

367
00:15:17,920 --> 00:15:20,740
我还以为他只是个不解风情的糟老头
Just when I thought he was a clueless grouch.

368
00:15:25,540 --> 00:15:27,600
这地方有几个大堂啊
How many lobbies does this place have?!

369
00:15:31,900 --> 00:15:34,180
打扰一下 哪里能买到泳衣
Excuse me. Where can I find a bathing suit?

370
00:15:34,340 --> 00:15:36,060
所有帐篷里都有附赠的泳衣
Oh, there are complimentary suits in all of the cabanas.

371
00:15:36,840 --> 00:15:39,160
别担心 我每晚亲自高温消毒
Worry not, I boil them myself nightly.

372
00:15:40,416 --> 00:15:42,180
机器人有这本事吗
Let's see a robot do that.

373
00:15:42,180 --> 00:15:44,980
希金斯 我们有个不寻常的小请求
Hi, Higgins. We have a bit of an unusual request.

374
00:15:45,040 --> 00:15:46,780
我们知道你必须谨言慎行 不过
Now, we know you need to be discreet, but...

375
00:15:46,780 --> 00:15:48,880
我们希望能和某位杰出的英国人
we are hoping to have a rendezvous

376
00:15:48,880 --> 00:15:50,420
来一场"不期而遇"
with a certain distinguished Brit.

377
00:15:51,460 --> 00:15:52,360
我会为二位安排
Consider it arranged.

378
00:15:52,877 --> 00:15:54,389
-好的 -好的
- Okay. - Okay.

379
00:15:59,800 --> 00:16:01,140
还是没看到女士们的踪迹
Still no sign of the ladies.

380
00:16:01,400 --> 00:16:02,540
或许她们是在另一个帐篷里
Maybe they're in a different cabana.

381
00:16:06,060 --> 00:16:06,360
我的到了
Mine's here.

382
00:16:06,700 --> 00:16:07,740
陪我等金发妹吧
Let's wait for the blonde.

383
00:16:08,000 --> 00:16:09,700
我只有在成双成对的时候才玩得开
I only know how to do this with even numbers.

384
00:16:10,260 --> 00:16:11,640
机器人先生
Hello, Mr. Robot!

385
00:16:12,040 --> 00:16:14,680
能告诉我我的浪漫惊喜在哪里吗
Can you tell me where to go for my romantic surprise?

386
00:16:15,540 --> 00:16:15,940
歌洛莉亚
Gloria?!

387
00:16:23,420 --> 00:16:24,960
现在我的到了 但你的走了
Now mine's here, but yours is gone.

388
00:16:29,660 --> 00:16:30,800
现在两个都跑了
Now they're both gone!

389
00:16:30,920 --> 00:16:31,700
她们会回来的
They'll be back.

390
00:16:31,960 --> 00:16:33,420
或许其中一个保姆出了问题
Maybe one of them had a nanny emergency.

391
00:16:33,660 --> 00:16:34,840
去里面等她们吧
Let's wait for them in there.

392
00:16:36,300 --> 00:16:36,740
小汉堡[滑水者]
Slider?

393
00:16:36,752 --> 00:16:38,300
很快就到 请进3号帐篷等
Arriving shortly. Cabana 3.

394
00:16:38,300 --> 00:16:39,180
谢谢
Thank you.

395
00:16:40,740 --> 00:16:42,260
那事不宜迟 我们开始吧
Here we are, then.

396
00:16:45,700 --> 00:16:46,700
希金斯 你在干什么
Higgins, what are you doing?!

397
00:16:47,180 --> 00:16:48,060
要玩角色扮演啊
Oh, role play.

398
00:16:48,960 --> 00:16:51,560
我知道我只是个低贱的马夫
I know I am but a lowly stable boy,

399
00:16:51,600 --> 00:16:53,440
不允许进入主人们的住宿区域
unwanted in the master's quarters, but --

400
00:16:53,440 --> 00:16:56,200
但或许你们会想要好好"教训"我呢
Perhaps you'd like to teach me a lesson?

401
00:16:56,840 --> 00:16:57,760
别伤到脸就行
Just stay away from the face.

402
00:16:57,760 --> 00:17:00,500
我们之间很明显有一些误会
Uh, obviously there's been some sort of misunderstanding.

403
00:17:00,500 --> 00:17:02,180
我们看起来像是那种
Yeah, do we look like the kind of people

404
00:17:02,180 --> 00:17:04,320
会喜欢跟别人玩奇怪角色扮演
that would be into some sort of weird role play

405
00:17:04,320 --> 00:17:05,680
而且是带马夫情节的人吗
involving a stable boy?

406
00:17:06,400 --> 00:17:07,500
我想他非常不乖
I'm assuming he's been naughty

407
00:17:07,500 --> 00:17:09,700
会愿意做任何事来保住自己的工作吧
and would do anything to keep his job.

408
00:17:09,980 --> 00:17:10,940
小卡 小卡
Cam -- Cam?

409
00:17:11,180 --> 00:17:13,560
为自己辩护一下 我其实很常接到这种要求
In my defense, I do get this request quite often.

410
00:17:13,640 --> 00:17:14,660
尤其是在圣诞节前后
Particularly around the holidays.

411
00:17:14,660 --> 00:17:15,514
其实呢...
Actually, um...

412
00:17:15,860 --> 00:17:19,740
我们很希望能跟某一对明星夫妇见面
we were hoping to meet a certain celebrity couple.

413
00:17:19,754 --> 00:17:21,212
无需多言
Yeah. Say no more.

414
00:17:21,240 --> 00:17:23,040
我不能做任何保证 但请两位稍等
I make no promises, but let me just

415
00:17:23,040 --> 00:17:24,840
等我穿好裤子 出浴缸尽力安排一下
wriggle back into my shorts and make some inquiries.

416
00:17:32,558 --> 00:17:34,051
来得真巧
Ah, wonderful timing!

417
00:17:34,160 --> 00:17:36,620
请移驾3号帐篷 您的神秘男士正在等候
Please step into Cabana 3 -- your mystery man awaits.

418
00:17:40,520 --> 00:17:41,200
你好啊
Hi.

419
00:17:41,780 --> 00:17:44,840
我知道我们不应该偷偷在这里见面
I know that you and I aren't supposed to be here,

420
00:17:44,840 --> 00:17:46,160
但经过我今天的经历
but after today,

421
00:17:46,160 --> 00:17:49,660
我不想再被恐惧控制生活
I am tired of living a life of fear.

422
00:17:50,020 --> 00:17:52,780
歌洛莉亚是克莱尔为我准备的棕发惊喜吗
Was Gloria Claire's brunette surprise?

423
00:17:53,060 --> 00:17:57,520
起因是克莱尔送了我"乐园"的入场券
It all started when Claire gave me a free pass to Fun Town.

424
00:17:58,180 --> 00:18:01,400
我就想 那今天来试试看
I thought, just try it today.

425
00:18:02,020 --> 00:18:06,000
放胆去"玩" 看看感觉如何
Take a ride, see how it feels.

426
00:18:06,156 --> 00:18:09,740
我以前都没发现你的脚那么性感啊
Oh. I never noticed how sexy your feet are.

427
00:18:09,740 --> 00:18:12,260
谢谢夸奖 但我们真的不可以 歌洛莉亚
Thank you, but this isn't happening, Gloria!

428
00:18:14,640 --> 00:18:17,420
你们在这里啊 抱歉我们晚到保龄球场了
Oh, there you are. Sorry we missed you at the bowling alley.

429
00:18:17,465 --> 00:18:20,100
她绑头带时跟现在看起来不太一样啊
She looked different with a headband on.

430
00:18:20,160 --> 00:18:21,780
先在按摩浴缸里暖身
Warming up in a hot tub first --

431
00:18:21,908 --> 00:18:25,240
不是寻常套路 但只要能让小贝放松就行
unconventional, but, hey, anything to loosen up Becks.

432
00:18:25,240 --> 00:18:26,320
我们有认识叫贝姬的吗
Did we meet a Becky?

433
00:18:26,640 --> 00:18:28,180
或许吧 当时那么多女人
Maybe. There were so many of them.

434
00:18:28,868 --> 00:18:31,260
所以小贝是几岁了来着
So, how old is this Becks?

435
00:18:32,540 --> 00:18:33,220
好戏上场啦
It's on.

436
00:18:34,000 --> 00:18:34,660
你们在这里啊
Oh, there you are.

437
00:18:38,421 --> 00:18:40,886
等等 你是小贝吗
Wait... you're Becks?

438
00:18:41,680 --> 00:18:43,480
是啊 我也十分有心想学
Yep, and I'm eager to learn.

439
00:18:43,480 --> 00:18:47,209
警告一下 我身材比较走形了 但我的腿功还是一流
A warning -- my form is clumsy, but I'm great on my feet.

440
00:18:51,540 --> 00:18:53,100
好吧 男的谁来
Okay, who gets the dude?

441
00:18:53,874 --> 00:18:55,160
这件事从未发生过
This never happened.

442
00:18:59,520 --> 00:19:00,580
行吧 我来处理他
Fine, I'll take him.

443
00:19:00,840 --> 00:19:03,120
但我跟他就只是先熟悉一下再看情况啊
But we're just gonna hang out and see where it goes.

444
00:19:13,320 --> 00:19:14,240
抱歉打扰了
Pardon the interruption.

445
00:19:14,440 --> 00:19:16,020
看来您已享用完滑水者[小汉堡]啦
It looks like you're finished with the slider?

446
00:19:16,180 --> 00:19:18,420
是啊 我能说句实话吗 我喜欢面包[屁股]大点
I am, and can I be honest? I prefer bigger buns.

447
00:19:18,700 --> 00:19:21,220
偶尔能这样男人与男人间聊天 感觉很不错吧
It's wonderful to just talk like men sometimes, isn't it?

448
00:19:21,260 --> 00:19:21,900
是啊
It is.

449
00:19:26,360 --> 00:19:27,680
杰 你怎么来了
Jay, what are you doing here?

450
00:19:27,680 --> 00:19:30,031
我花了一天的时间在找一个王八...
I've spent the whole day looking for that miserable --

451
00:19:32,774 --> 00:19:34,300
你就是那个毛衫美食家吗
You're the Foodie in a Who-dy?!

452
00:19:34,320 --> 00:19:35,650
你为何会这么认为呢
W-Why would you say that?

453
00:19:37,960 --> 00:19:38,400
番茄酱
Ketchup!

454
00:19:38,640 --> 00:19:40,140
我很努力了 但真的没听懂你的话
I'm trying, but I'm lost!

455
00:19:40,360 --> 00:19:41,660
你侮辱了我妈
You insulted my mother!

456
00:19:41,694 --> 00:19:44,520
天啊 你是厨巨王走吗
Oh, my God. You're Close to Utlaw?!

457
00:19:44,520 --> 00:19:45,780
是橱柜狂徒
It's Closet Outlaw!

458
00:19:45,980 --> 00:19:47,420
杰 你生气我不怪你
Jay, I don't blame you for being mad.

459
00:19:47,780 --> 00:19:50,460
我让我的粉丝大军去喷了你 还有...
I-I turned my legions of fans against you, and, uh...

460
00:19:50,944 --> 00:19:52,000
其实是叫帽衫美食家啦
it's Foodie in a Hoodie, by -- by the way.

461
00:19:52,000 --> 00:19:54,200
但我刚听说你家有个比这个严重多了的问题啊
But you got a bigger problem at home that I just heard about,

462
00:19:54,220 --> 00:19:55,620
我觉得我能帮到你
and I think I can help you with it.

463
00:19:55,740 --> 00:19:57,520
-克莱尔 -歌洛莉亚
- Claire? - Oh! Gloria.

464
00:19:57,520 --> 00:19:59,020
真不敢相信你能认出我
I can't believe you recognized me.

465
00:19:59,080 --> 00:20:00,780
我的头发真是很对不起了
I'm so sorry about my hair.

466
00:20:01,220 --> 00:20:04,480
我很高兴我们终于可以聊这件事了
I'm so glad that we can finally talk about it.

467
00:20:04,560 --> 00:20:07,440
你就放心让它长吧 让你自己当个女孩
Grow it out, let yourself be a girl.

468
00:20:08,180 --> 00:20:09,680
好的 最后的安排
Okay, final set of instructions

469
00:20:09,680 --> 00:20:11,880
今天的一切绝对会是我将要出版的回忆录
on a day that will no doubt be a memorable chapter

470
00:20:11,880 --> 00:20:14,255
《有何能效劳》中 十分精彩的篇章
in my forthcoming memoir, "You Rang?"

471
00:20:14,284 --> 00:20:15,437
您 去2号帐篷
You, Cabana 2.

472
00:20:15,437 --> 00:20:16,472
您 去3号帐篷
You, Cabana 3.

473
00:20:19,960 --> 00:20:21,880
你真浪漫
You are romantic.

474
00:20:24,120 --> 00:20:26,260
亲爱的 如果你不喜欢我的头发 我可以改掉
Honey, if you don't like my hair, I can change it.

475
00:20:26,260 --> 00:20:27,394
什么 我很喜欢啊
What? I love it.

476
00:20:27,640 --> 00:20:29,120
或许下周我可以给你安排
Maybe next week I can arrange

477
00:20:29,120 --> 00:20:31,490
与红发女郎的一场约会
a little rendezvous with a redhead.

478
00:20:33,155 --> 00:20:34,526
好的
O-Okay.

479
00:20:34,940 --> 00:20:36,420
消除刚才的误会真是太好了
I'm glad we cleared that up.

480
00:20:36,540 --> 00:20:38,400
我真是等不及要跟你上保龄球课了
I can't wait for my bowling lesson with you.

481
00:20:38,700 --> 00:20:39,500
天啊
Oh, my God.

482
00:20:40,061 --> 00:20:42,036
帽衫美食家今天来过这里呢
Foot-y in a Hoodie was here today.

483
00:20:42,348 --> 00:20:43,761
你真是太棒了
Ah, you're great.

484
00:20:44,260 --> 00:20:45,480
时髦辣妹什么时候来呢
When does Posh get here?

485
00:20:45,800 --> 00:20:47,240
很抱歉迟到了
And I apologize for being late.

486
00:20:47,240 --> 00:20:48,780
我其实有给你语音信箱留言呢
You know, I-I left a message.

487
00:20:48,780 --> 00:20:49,840
抱歉错过了你的电话
I'm sorry I missed your call.

488
00:20:49,920 --> 00:20:51,000
你能再说一次这句子吗
Can you say that one more time?

489
00:20:53,706 --> 00:20:57,818
我收到了昨天的杂项费用账单
So, I got a few incidental charges from yesterday.

490
00:20:58,255 --> 00:21:01,020
200块钱的甜心宝宝购入费
Two hundred dollars for sugar babie procurement.

491
00:21:01,020 --> 00:21:01,520
抱歉
Sorry.

492
00:21:02,060 --> 00:21:04,660
还有8个小汉堡以及1瓶椰子水
Eight sliders and one coconut water?

493
00:21:04,760 --> 00:21:05,980
那瓶水他也收我钱啊
He charged me for that?

494
00:21:05,980 --> 00:21:08,156
300块钱的滑水道救援费
Three hundred dollars for a slide rescue.

495
00:21:08,504 --> 00:21:11,600
40块钱的使用健身单车后未清洁的罚款
Forty dollars fine for the non-wiping of stationary bike.

496
00:21:11,600 --> 00:21:12,580
我都没怎么流汗啊
I barely sweat.

497
00:21:12,580 --> 00:21:13,820
你现在就满头汗了吧
You are sweating right now.

498
00:21:13,820 --> 00:21:17,207
150元的护腿未还罚款
A hundred and fifty dollars fine for the non-return of legwarmers.

499
00:21:17,429 --> 00:21:20,836
8张100块钱的西部世界门票
And eight one hundred dollar west world entry fees?

500
00:21:23,225 --> 00:21:25,100
天啊 我们把小卡忘在那里了
Oh my God! We left Cam there.

501
00:21:25,100 --> 00:21:26,200
糟了
Oh no!
